<title>INDONESIA: Asahimas 1996 net falls to 44.07 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Asahimas 1996 net falls to 44.07 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  44.07   vs   73.71</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    102    vs   208</p>
<p>    Net sales			  347.29   vs  403.59</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     124.83   vs  190.27</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 51.29    vs  116.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   53.87    vs   84.49</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		100.14   vs   66.92</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT Asahimas Flat Glass Co., Ltd. is a glass maker. --- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
